   "instructionsEn": "Directions: In this part of the test, each test item has three pictures (A), (B), and (C). You will hear a dialogue between two speakers, with four sentences altogether. After each dialogue, someone will ask a question about the dialogue. Please choose the picture that best answers this question. Each dialogue will be read twice, with a 5-second pause in between each reading. After the second reading, you will have five seconds to mark your answer before a new test item begins.",
